/* 大世界街巷与荒野奇遇库 / V5 分情况设计：发现→动手→结果页检定→后续推进 / 100 passages */
:: MP World Deep Router [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>>
<<set _allWorldScenes to ["MP World Event Loose Cobble", "MP World Event Curio Peddler", "MP World Event Smuggler Drop", "MP World Event Driftwood Chest", "MP World Event Forest Shrine", "MP World Event Park Sketchbook", "MP World Event Temple Censer", "MP World Event Sewer Cache", "MP World Event Barb Patrol", "MP World Event Danube Carriage", "MP World Event School Corridor", "MP World Event Pool Steam", "MP World Event Arcade Neon", "MP World Event Shopping Mirror", "MP World Event Hospital Night", "MP World Event Brothel Backdoor", "MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow", "MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope", "MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin", "MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles", "MP World Connudatus PosterCompactBox", "MP World Cliff BenchArmrestRoll", "MP World Wolf HitchingRingPouch", "MP World High HydrantCardCase", "MP World Starfish IceCreamPostTin", "MP World Nightingale VentAmberVial", "MP World Oxford UmbrellaStandPenBox", "MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag", "MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock", "MP World Harvest FlourSackCashbox", "MP World ResAlley GeraniumPotWrap", "MP World ComAlley FreightShaftPurse", "MP World IndAlley BoilerColdAshBox", "MP World Beach CabanaSpyglassTube", "MP World SeaRocks ReefCorkBottle", "MP World BeachCave StalactiteTinderbox", "MP World Forest CypressRootTin", "MP World Library TopBeamBookmarkTin", "MP World Canteen MilkCrateCoinPurse", "MP World TempleGarden RosebushCeladonVial", "MP World OceanBreeze ParasolTieClip", "MP World Pub KegStackWineskin", "MP World Police ReportBoxParchment", "MP World AdultShop ExhaustVelvetBag", "MP World Garden ToolshedRustedCan", "MP World Orphanage UnderstairsWoodBox", "MP World Bedroom BaseboardIronTin"]>>
<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes.filter(function (n) { return !$mpSeenScenes[n]; })>>
<<if _pool.length is 0>>
	<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes>>
	<<set $mpSeenScenes to {}>>
<</if>>
<<set _pick to _pool.random()>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes[_pick] to 1>>
<<include _pick>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
你走过宅邸街拐角时，脚下一块松动的青石板微微下陷了半寸。石板边缘的湿苔刚被人用扁铁刮开，露出新刻的白色三角记号。冬青篱笆后方静悄悄的，只有风吹过铁艺信箱的轻响。你停住脚步低头打量，盘算着要不要撬开石板看看。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[撬开松动石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[躲在篱笆后观察 (0:08)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Wait]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向路过的罗宾搭话 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开街角 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你蹲在墙根阴影里，用指尖扣住青石板边缘慢慢往上抬。砖槽下方裹着一层防潮油纸，隐约露出铜币与字条的边角。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回宅邸街 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<link "核对底单门牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to ((($mpDomusRunnerSeen or 0) is 1) ? 220 : 300)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 900>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 780>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 650>>
<<set $mpClues["bailey_domus_drop"] to 1>>
你顺着砖缝轻轻抽起油纸包，摸出几枚旧银币与半张记着门牌缩写的催缴底单。你把大约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的硬币收进口袋。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
石板底下卡着一根生锈的防盗铁钉，猛地划破了你的食指指腹。院墙内传来猎犬凶狠的狂吠，你只好空手把石板放回原位。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对底单门牌 (0:06)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[翻进邻院木棚 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 520>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开滑处再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Wait [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpDomusRunnerSeen to 1>>
你缩进修剪整齐的冬青树篱后方，借着浓密的枝叶遮住身形。过了不到一刻钟，一名压低帽檐的少年快步走过拐角，用鞋尖在青石板右侧轻轻磕了两下。他确认石板未动便匆匆离去，让你看清了避开砖槽铁钉的巧劲。你缓缓吐出一口气，紧绷的神经放松下来。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[趁没人撬开石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去找罗宾问问 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>
罗宾正抱着一摞洗净的亚麻床单从街对面走来，看见你蹲在墙角便停下了脚步。「你也注意到那个白粉笔三角了吗？」罗宾左右看了看，压低声音对你说，「前天夜里贝利派人去工业区地下的高压泵站送过一样的账袋。」说完罗宾冲你露出关切的微笑，叮嘱你在街上多加小心。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头查探青石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[比对底单暗号 (0:06)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[告别罗宾离开 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你靠在路灯铁柱下展开那半张油纸，上面密密麻麻写着一串倒置的门牌数字与日期。你顺着宅邸街两侧的门牌号逐一推算其中的进位规律。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-cipher">
<<runicon>><<link "转进邻院木棚 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-cipher">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($english or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["bailey_ledger_code"] to 1>>
	<<if (($maths or 0) gte 600 or ($english or 0) gte 600) and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_cobble_cipher")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
	你很快算出每组数字都代表着孤儿院欠款的拆借利息，还在折痕夹层里摸到一枚铜质火漆印章。这套暗码足以在查账时派上用场。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着眉目往前 (0:03)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	纸面上的缩写符号夹杂着多处涂改，你看来看去只觉得头昏脑涨。冷风吹得纸页哗哗作响，你只好先把底单折好收起。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住呼吸再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
巷口忽然传来沉重的皮靴声，一名替贝利收账的打手正朝拐角走来。你立刻翻过低矮的木栅栏，闪身钻进邻院堆放园艺工具的木棚里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从侧门回街上 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-shed">
<<walkicon>><<link "绕回石板拐角 (0:03)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-shed">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 300>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 700>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif ($athletics or 0) gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>>
你轻巧地落在干草垫上，顺手从挂在木钉上的旧猎装口袋里摸出一袋散碎银币，约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。打手在墙外停了片刻便走远了。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
你落地时脚踝拌在铁锹柄上，发出清脆的碰撞声。你捂住磕疼的膝盖屏住呼吸，直到墙外的脚步声远去才敢挪动。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:03)|MP World Event Loose Cobble]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 600>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调整手法再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
高街廊檐下的流动旧货摊前，一名披着灰斗篷的货郎正低头擦拭几只沾满铜绿的航海罗盘。油布摊面上摆着旧发条盒、黄铜望远镜筒与散落的外国硬币。货郎听见你的脚步声，抬起半掩在兜帽下的眼睛打量了你一下。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[挑拣摊上铜器 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[花三镑买枚旧币 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Bargain]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[帮他分拣机芯 (0:15)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开旧货摊 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
你蹲在旧货摊边，手指掠过几只生锈的铁皮怀表，停在一只刻着海浪纹的扁平黄铜鼻烟盒上。盒底的接缝比寻常器物厚了半分，似乎藏着双层夹板。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-inspect">
<<walkicon>><<link "钻进摊后帆布棚 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-inspect">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($history or 0), ($skulduggery or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Curio_Peddler")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你借着袖口掩护按开盒底暗簧，摸出夹层里的旧金镑与一张航海图残角，转手兑出了约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
你用力掰扯盒盖时发出咔哒异响，货郎立刻伸手把鼻烟盒收回绒布袋里，冷冷地盯着你看了半晌。
<<stress 5>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进摊后帆布棚 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[替货郎留意街口 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 640>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Bargain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_pier"] to 1>>
<<if $money gte 300>>
<<money -300>>
你摸出几枚硬币放在油布上，指了指那枚印着灯塔与折断船锚的古怪铜币。货郎将硬币扫进掌心，压低嗓音说：「认得这枚雾角锚记的人可不多，退潮时顺着海礁往外走，就能登上雾角栈桥。」他把铜币塞进你手里，示意你去后面的帆布棚避风细看。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[进入摊后帆布棚 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[留下帮忙分拣 (0:15)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<else>>
你摸遍口袋也凑不出那几枚硬币。货郎把铜币收回油布下，摇了摇头。
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
货郎递给你一瓶煤油与一把硬毛小刷，让你把木盘里沾满海盐结晶的黄铜齿轮按齿数分好。你在小马扎上坐下，借着廊檐天光逐一清理零件上的锈迹。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-appraise">
<<walkicon>><<link "退进摊后帆布棚 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-appraise">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), ($housekeeping or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1300>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 1000>>
你手脚麻利地将二十多枚擒纵轮分门别类摆好，货郎满意地点点头，数出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的工钱递给你。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
刺鼻的煤油味熏得你眼眶发酸，你不小心把两枚细小的游丝弄混在了一起，被货郎皱着眉头扣下了报酬。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势往里追查 (0:03)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 720>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "commercial">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"] to 1>>
廊檐后方的防雨帆布棚挡住了街面的寒风，棚内点着一盏温暖的防风马灯。货郎掀开罗盘底盖给你看了一行刻在铜片上的潮汐时刻：「每逢初七夜潮，雾角灯塔的备用油船都会按这个刻度靠岸。」你把那串数字默记在心里，冻僵的指尖也渐渐回暖。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[替货郎把风望哨 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回到摊位前 (0:02)|MP World Event Curio Peddler]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开帆布棚 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
两名便衣巡警忽然从高街路口走来，目光径直锁定了廊檐下的流动旧货摊。货郎脸色微变，急忙用胳膊肘碰了碰你，示意你帮他把那匣未打税的怀表塞进排水沟暗格。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[快步离开高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-watch">
<<walkicon>><<link "返回旧货摊 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-watch">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1100>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_curio_watch")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你假装系鞋带蹲下身，三两下将木匣推入铁栅内侧。巡警搜查无果离开后，货郎塞给你约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的封口费。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
你的手指刚碰到木匣就被巡警厉声喝止，一名巡警上前推了你一把，你的后背重重撞在廊柱上。
<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按新线索前行 (0:03)|MP World Event Curio Peddler]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 800>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
码头暗巷的排水铁栅旁塞着一只涂满石蜡的防水油布包，上面还带着咸腥的海水味。不远处的货运栈桥下传来低沉的柴油机怠速声，似乎是走私暗桩刚放下的交接货。你贴着集装箱的阴影停下脚步，观察着四周的动静。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:06)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[观察船坞风灯 (0:06)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Signal]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入木造船棚 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开码头暗巷 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
你蹲在排水铁栅边，趁着巡逻哨兵转过堆场拐角的空档，将手指探进铁条缝隙勾住油布包的麻绳。油布包沉甸甸的，里面似乎垫着金属器皿。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-inspect">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "去缆绳堆找熟人 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to ((($mpDockDropEdge or 0) is 1) ? 250 : 350)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1150>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Smuggler_Drop")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你巧劲一拧便将油布包完整拖了出来，从夹层摸出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的暗市现钞与铅封货单。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
沉重的生铁栅栏突然滑落，狠狠夹中了你的手腕。巷口哨兵的手电光柱扫了过来，你只好忍痛缩手退后。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去缆绳堆找熟人 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[跨过跳板脱身 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 820>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开滑处再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Signal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>><<set $mpDockDropEdge to 1>>
你躲进堆满防水油布的货垛后面，静静听着外海雾角传来两长一短的低鸣。紧接着，东侧防波堤尽头的旧船坞亮起三下绿光，一艘无标驳船顺着暗流滑进了黑铁货运滑道。你看清了哨兵换岗的间隙，心里对接下来的行动更有把握了。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头取油布包 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进木造船棚 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks_building">><<effects>>
木造船棚内弥漫着桐油与松木屑的气味，隔绝了外面的海风。角落里立着一只印有折断船锚烙印的杉木箱，箱盖四周钉着一圈铁皮箍条，旁边放着半截铁撬棍。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[走出木造船棚 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-shed">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "去缆绳堆交涉 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-shed">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 14000>><<set _reward to 1300>><<elseif ($physique or 0) gte 11500>><<set _reward to 1000>>
你握紧铁撬棍抵住木箱接缝，沉腰发力将铁皮箍条整根撬起，从刨花底下摸出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的押运定金。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
你用尽全力往下压撬棍，木箱纹丝不动，反震的力道震得你虎口发麻，肩膀也隐隐作痛。
<<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[带着发现前行 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 720>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"] to 1>>
一名戴着毛线帽的码头水手正靠在粗麻缆绳堆上抽烟，看见你手里的石蜡碎屑便挑了挑眉。「雷恩交代过，这批货要是有人动过就改走雾角水道。」水手吐出一口白烟，把一张画着暗礁航标的草图塞进你手心。他压低声音催促你别在铁栅边久留，因为海关快艇今晚查得很严。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回到排水栅栏 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[直接离开码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
尖锐的铜哨声忽然划破码头夜雾，两名提着防风灯的海关稽查员从栈桥另一端包抄过来。你必须趁他们合围前跨过湿滑的系船浮板。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头大道 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-escape">
<<walkicon>><<link "绕回暗巷入口 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-escape">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 350>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif ($athletics or 0) gte 550>><<set _reward to 750>>
你助跑两步踩上系船铁柱，干净利落地翻上高处货台，顺手捡起暗桩逃跑时掉在木板上的约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 零钞。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
湿滑的海藻让你在浮板上脚下一滑，小腿重重磕在铁链上，你狼狈地滚进集装箱缝隙才躲过搜捕。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>><<trauma 1>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势往里追查 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 520>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调整手法再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>>
退潮的海浪在礁石浅滩边冲上了一只缠满墨绿海带的樟木小匣，黄铜搭扣已经在海水浸泡下松脱了大半。冰凉的浪花不断拍打着礁盘，每当浪头退去，木匣就会在石缝间微微晃动。你站在干湿交界的沙地上，打量着礁石间的潮水深浅。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:06)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[坐等潮水退平 (0:08)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Tide]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进礁后海洞 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开礁石浅滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>>
你挽起裤脚踏进冰凉的海水里，双手扣住樟木小匣两侧往外拔。湿滑的墨绿海带缠在礁石棱角上，需要不小的力气才能扯断。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-inspect">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "与岸边泳客交谈 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-inspect">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500 or ($mpBeachTideCalm or 0) is 1>>
	<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 900>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Driftwood_Chest")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你稳住下盘扯断海带，扳开铜扣从防水内胆里摸出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的古银币与一枚航海怀表。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
一股暗涌突然拍在你的膝弯上，你的脚掌滑进布满藤壶的石槽，锋利的贝壳划破了脚踝皮肤。
<<pain 4>><<stress 5>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[与岸边泳客交谈 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[应对突发暗涌 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 620>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Tide [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>>
<<set $mpBeachTideCalm to 1>>
你没有急着下水，而是坐在一块晒得微温的花岗岩上，静静数着拍岸的浪头。等到第七道大浪退向深海，礁盘凹槽里的积水顺着石缝哗哗流干，那只樟木小匣完完全全露在了干爽的沙砾上。温和的海风拂过脸颊，让你紧绷的肩背松弛下来。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前打开木匣 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[探查礁后海洞 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
礁石后方的岩洞挡住了海面上的风浪，洞顶垂下几缕干燥的海草。洞壁角落堆着几块早年沉船冲进来的旧船板，木缝里卡着一只黄铜密封筒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开岩洞回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-cave">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "出洞找泳客聊聊 (0:05)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-cave">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 760>>
<<set $mpClues["wreck_chart_fragment"] to 1>>
你避开腐朽的木刺拧开铜筒，抽出半卷标着暗礁水道的羊皮海图，并在船板下捡到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的硬币。
<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
你的手刚伸进船板底下就惊动了一群藏在暗处的青蟹，密密麻麻的声响吓得你急忙缩手后退。
<<stress 5>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 540>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>>
梅森正站在防波堤阶梯旁用毛巾擦拭湿发，看见你手里拿着一块带船徽的樟木片便走了过来。「这是早年雾角商船上的徽记，」梅森指了指远海雾气笼罩的方向，「灯塔岛东侧有片断桅沉船滩，退潮时经常能看到整排的旧船肋木。」梅森笑着拍了拍你的肩膀，叮嘱你下水时注意暗流。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[去浅滩边缘试水 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回到礁石浅滩 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>>
你正准备从礁盘边缘转身离开，一道半人高的白头浪忽然越过外侧礁脊，裹挟着冰冷的泡沫狠狠拍向你的腰际。脚下的细沙在回卷暗流中迅速流失。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-undertow">
<<walkicon>><<link "返回礁石浅滩 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-undertow">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	你咬紧牙关屏住呼吸，双手死死扣住身旁的玄武岩凸起，等浪头泄尽力道才稳步跨上干爽的沙岸。
	<<willpower 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[带着发现前行 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰冷的浪涌冲得你重心尽失，你在咸涩的海水里呛了一口，手脚并用地爬上沙滩时已经累得气喘吁吁。
	<<tiredness 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
林间两棵合抱粗的古橡树之间立着一座布满青苔的小石龛，龛内散落着半干的蓝冠草与几枚奉纳旧币。树冠筛下斑驳的绿影，空气里透着腐殖土与松针的清香。石龛底座的一角微微翘起，似乎曾有守林人在此落脚。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查探供台石板 (0:06)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[采拢周边草药 (0:12)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Herbs]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向林间猎人问路 (0:05)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Gwylan]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开古树石龛 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
你蹲在石龛正面，小心拨开缠绕在底座四周的刺藤与枯叶。松动的青石供台下方有一道干燥的石槽，里面隐约泛着青铜器物的幽光。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-inspect">
<<walkicon>><<link "钻进古树根洞 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-inspect">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 820>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Forest_Shrine")>>
