:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Gwylan [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
林间鹿径上传来踩踏枯枝的轻响，一名背着竹篓的采药人停在石龛旁歇脚。「这座小龛只是外围的路标，」对方看了一眼你衣角沾着的苔藓，抬手指向密林深处，「顺着双生橡树北面的白桦林走，就能找到真正的德鲁伊石环祭坛。」说完对方朝你点点头，转身隐入林雾之中。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[躲进古树根洞 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Hollow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头查探石龛 (0:05)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Hollow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"] to 1>>
两棵古橡树盘根错节的底部围出了一处干爽的树根空腔，刚好能容一人弯腰钻进去避风。空腔内壁的木质坚硬光滑，上面用猎刀刻着一圈记录朔望月交替的古老符号。你靠在散发着木香的树壁上描下那组符号，林间的寒意被隔绝在外。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[应对林外狼嚎 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 4>><</link>>
