<<walkicon>><<link [[钻出树洞回石龛 (0:02)|MP World Event Forest Shrine]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
灌木丛后方忽然响起两声低沉的咆哮，几双幽绿的眼睛在昏暗的蕨类植物间一闪而过。你深吸一口气，伸手抓住古橡树垂下的粗壮横枝。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[快步返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
