:: MP World Event Temple Censer Chore [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
一名负责清扫回廊的侍从递给你一块绒布，请你帮忙把侧廊十二座黄铜烛台上的蜡泪擦洗干净。安静的祈祷声从正厅传来，让你渐渐沉下心来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿大厅 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
