<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你用指甲拨开铜丝刮去黑蜡，从盒内取出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的不记名银票与一把万能匙坯。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
铜丝崩断的瞬间弹起一只生锈的捕鼠铁夹，啪地打在你的手背上，火辣辣的剧痛让你差点滑下高台。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[与巡渠拾荒人交谈 (0:05)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Peddler]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[攀上铁梯躲避泄洪 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Surge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 760>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
