:: MP World Event Pool Steam Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>>
你蹲在温热的瓷砖地面上，用手指扣住杉木排水格栅的边缘轻轻往上抬。格栅下方的浅水槽里卡着一条金链与一只密封的防水铜管。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<link "核对九号器材柜 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($swimmingskill or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 750>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Pool_Steam")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你灵巧地勾出那条纯金吊坠与九号储物牌，拧开防水铜管倒出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的备用硬币。
<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
湿滑的杉木格栅突然脱手砸下，压痛了你的无名指指尖，你只好揉着手指先站起身来。
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对九号器材柜 (0:05)|MP World Event Pool Steam Locker]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[避开嬉闹学生 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Prank]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 500>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻力道再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Pool Steam Mason [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>>
梅森正蹲在深水区池畔盘拢蓝白相间的分道浮绳，水珠顺着健硕的肩背滑落。你走上前帮梅森扶住浮标转轴，顺便问起更衣室旧储物柜的事。「最里面那排器材柜是以前潜水社留下的，」梅森冲你爽朗一笑，顺便教了你一个在水下耳压平衡时放松胸腔的换气诀窍。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
