	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:03)|MP World Event Pool Steam Locker]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _reward to 450>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Clean]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam Locker [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["pool_locker_token"] to 1>>
你走进温暖干燥的毛巾烘干室，顺着角落那排旧铁柜找到印着「玖」字的柜门。拉开柜门后，里面挂着一副老式黄铜护目镜，镜盒底下压着一张塑封防水卡片，详细记录着海岸礁洞与海蚀回音廊的平潮时间表。你把卡片上的时刻记在心里，重新掩好了柜门。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[避开门外嬉闹人群 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Prank]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
